  <rdfs:label>IsSpecialAuthorizedCriminalProcessing</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment>Activity {a} is authorised by Union or Member State law providing for appropriate safeguards
       for the rights and freedoms of data subject to process data relating to criminal convictions
       and offences</rdfs:comment>
